audiosrc": "engenn7le11ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Hey Peter, any luck with speed dating? Have you met your other half yet?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Very funny. That must feel natural for you, but not for me. I wish I were as successful with girls as you are. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        It doesn't always work out, you know.   For example, there was this girl I really liked. We hit it off immediately and had a lot of fun on the first date. I thought we matched up pretty well . I could have fallen for her, but in the end I realized that she was leading me on.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "34000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I know the feeling! I fell head over heels for a girl who was into comics and movies like me, but our date didn't go anywhere. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        That may not have been easy for you. I know how much you like your superheroes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I wish she liked me, too, besides Batman and Superman.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "52000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Don't worry about her. There must be someone who's right for you out there!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:        I just wish I was less awkward when I talk to someone I don't know. It can't be hard for you. You ask girls out all the time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mike</span>:        Keep trying. If you have good chemistry with someone, you'll know straight away.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le11ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le11ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}]}]}